"Bitwarden is selected for secret storage, but you are not signed in. "
"Passwords and passphrases will not be stored or autofilled until you sign in "
"and unlock your vault.\n"
"\n"
"Open Settings ▸ Security & Credentials to change the backend, or sign in now."
